    content: irregular blob of one foreground color, ~63-81% fill in source half
    axis: contiguous yellow line (H or V), spanning 57-100% of bbox cross-dimension
    control_pixel: exactly 1 off-axis yellow pixel, perpendicular distance = 2 from axis, within axis span
    halves: source half >= target half (equal or source 1 row/col larger)
